#: quickbook/specialAppInfoFakeDummyForL10nScript.php:4
msgid ""
"Quick Booking adds a public booking page for the appointment schedules you already have in the Calendar app. Requires the Calendar app.\n"
"\n"
"Visitors pick a date and time, enter their details, review and confirm on the same page. The appointment is booked immediately and the usual booking confirmation email (with .ics) is sent.\n"
"\n"
"* Share the usual Calendar booking link (\"Copy link\" in the Calendar app): it opens Quick Booking.\n"
"* One-time appointment schedules: offer appointments on one or more chosen dates (e.g. parent-teacher conferences) instead of weekly. Create them in the Calendar app under \"One-time appointment schedules\".\n"
"* Built-in rate limiting of bookings per visitor and per email address.\n"
"* Self-check: verifies after every Calendar or Nextcloud update that it still works, and lets the booking link show the standard Calendar booking page when something breaks."
msgstr ""
"Quick Booking inaongeza ukurasa wa umma wa kukatisha nafasi kwa ratiba za miadi ulizo nazo tayari katika programu ya Calendar. Inahitaji programu ya Calendar.\n"
"\n"
"Wageni huchagua tarehe na saa, huweka taarifa zao, hupitia na kuthibitisha kwenye ukurasa uleule. Muadi hukatishiwa nafasi papo hapo na barua pepe ya kawaida ya uthibitisho (yenye .ics) hutumwa.\n"
"\n"
"* Shiriki kiungio cha kawaida cha kukatisha nafasi cha Calendar (\"Nakili kiungio\" katika programu ya Calendar): kinafungua Quick Booking.\n"
"* Ratiba za miadi za mara moja: toa miadi katika tarehe moja au zaidi ulizochagua (k.m. mikutano ya wazazi na walimu) badala ya kila wiki. Zitengeneze katika programu ya Calendar chini ya \"Ratiba za miadi za mara moja\".\n"
"* Kikomo kilichojengewa ndani cha idadi ya nafasi zinazokatishwa kwa kila mgeni na kwa kila barua pepe.\n"
"* Ukaguzi binafsi: baada ya kila sasisho la Calendar au Nextcloud, inahakikisha kwamba bado inafanya kazi, na kitu kikiharibika inafanya kiungio cha kukatisha nafasi kionyeshe ukurasa wa kawaida wa kukatisha nafasi wa Calendar."

